Level 3 - found a pair of gauntlets of power lying around
Level 4 - killed a large kobold, who dropped another pair of gauntlets
of power

Found the mines on level four, and descended to minetown.  I always go
down to minetown, then back to Sokoban, then back down to the end of
the mines.  This is due to a fear of deep polytraps in the mines.

